  "graph": {
    "name": "Jubilant FoodWorks: Driving a Quality Customer Experience Using Data Lake",
    "link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G07keU4g-LU",
    "categories": "data_ingestion",
    "graph_usable": true,
    "notes": "1250 restaurants, 200K pizzas delivery in 30 min. Responsible to deliver on time. Trying to solve scale - 1500 orders per min during peak hours. Solving data availability - data latency, weeks before the insights were available to campaigning team. Hot curated data(past 5-6 months) is moved from S3 to redshift. Redshift spectrum transparently joins the data and gives it to user in case data is not present in Redshift. Business insights that are triggered on adhoc basis are served by Athena as redshift has only 5-6 months old data. Future Plans - More data sources need to be plugged in, Sage maker to power forecasting and personalization engines to enhance consumer experience."
  },
